  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Joint Police Programme II (JPP II) is a three-year programme that continues to address the efficiency, effectiveness, transparency, and accountability of police service delivery to Somali citizens, while supporting the institutional and operational capacities of the federal- and state-level security and police institutions, with a focus on human rights and gender-responsive measures</narrative>
